          distance of the beamstop to the detector.
          Note, it is recommended to use NXtransformations instead.
        </rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">https://manual.nexusformat.org/classes/base_classes/NXbeam_stop.html#nxbeam-stop-distance-to-detector-field</rdfs:seeAlso>
</owl:Class>

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.org/nexusformat/definitions/Field/NXbeam_stop/status">
  <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="#NeXusField"/>
  <rdfs:subClassOf>
