      adjacency list is specified using an array data type where the elements
      of the array are the indices of the adjacent overlapped reflection 
    </rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">https://manual.nexusformat.org/classes/base_classes/NXreflections.html#nxreflections-overlaps-field</rdfs:seeAlso>
</owl:Class>

